t.getElementById(`menu-visit-open`)?.addEventListener(`click`,e=>{e.stopPropagation(),e.preventDefault(),document.body.classList.remove(`menu-visit-open`,`menu-see-and-do-open`),document.body.classList.add(`menu-visit-open`)}),document.getElementById(`menu-see-and-do-open`)?.addEventListener(`click`,e=>{e.stopPropagation(),e.preventDefault(),document.body.classList.remove(`menu-visit-open`,`menu-see-and-do-open`),document.body.classList.add(`menu-see-and-do-open`)}),document.getElementById(`menu-close`)?.addEventListener(`click`,e=>{e.stopPropagation(),e.preventDefault(),document.body.classList.remove(`menu-visit-open`,`menu-see-and-do-open`)});var e=document.getElementsByClassName(`menu-back`);Array.from(e).forEach(e=>{e?.addEventListener(`click`,e=>{e.stopPropagation(),e.preventDefault(),document.body.classList.remove(`menu-visit-open`,`menu-see-and-do-open`)})}),document.body.addEventListener(`click`,()=>{document.body.classList.remove(`menu-visit-open`,`menu-see-and-do-open`)});</script></nav><script type=\"module\">document.getElementById(`menu-open`)?.addEventListener(`click`,e=>{e.stopPropagation(),e.preventDefault(),document.body.classList.add(`menu-open`)}),document.getElementById(`menu-close`)?.addEventListener(`click`,e=>{e.stopPropagation(),e.preventDefault(),document.body.classList.remove(`menu-open`)});</script><header class=\"header-page header-event\" data-astro-cid-a7plf7qh><div class=\"header-inner\" data-astro-cid-a7plf7qh><div class=\"header-image-wrapper\" data-astro-cid-a7plf7qh><div class=\"header-image\" style=\"background-image:url(https://assets.rafmuseum.org.uk/app/uploads/2025/12/17093534/Top_Gun_Outdoor_Cinema_digi.jpg)\" data-astro-cid-a7plf7qh><img src=\"https://assets.rafmuseum.org.uk/app/uploads/2025/12/17093534/Top_Gun_Outdoor_Cinema_digi.jpg\" data-astro-cid-a7plf7qh></div></div><div class=\"breadcrumbs\" data-astro-cid-xpmtjp3f><ul data-astro-cid-xpmtjp3f><li data-astro-cid-xpmtjp3f><a href=\"/\" data-astro-cid-xpmtjp3f>Home</a></li><li data-astro-cid-xpmtjp3f><a href=\"/london/\" data-astro-cid-xpmtjp3f>London</a></li><li data-astro-cid-xpmtjp3f><a href=\"/london/whats-going-on/page/1/\" data-astro-cid-xpmtjp3f>What’s on</a></li><li data-astro-cid-xpmtjp3f><span data-astro-cid-xpmtjp3f>Propellers and Popcorn</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"header-content\" data-astro-cid-a7plf7qh><h1 data-astro-cid-a7plf7qh>Propellers and Popcorn</h1></div></div></header><main data-astro-cid-63olytii><div class=\"event-detail\" data-astro-cid-63olytii><div class=\"event-details\" data-astro-cid-xhit6z5e><div class=\"booking-content\" data-astro-cid-xhit6z5e><div class=\"info-row info-row-location\" data-astro-cid-xhit6z5e><span data-astro-cid-xhit6z5e>London</span></div><div class=\"info-row info-row-date\" data-astro-cid-xhit6z5e><span data-astro-cid-xhit6z5e><span data-astro-cid-xhit6z5e>22 August 2026 - 23 August 2026</span></span></div><div class=\"info-row info-row-audience\" data-astro-cid-xhit6z5e><span data-astro-cid-xhit6z5e>Ages 13+</span></div><div class=\"info-row info-row-price\" data-astro-cid-xhit6z5e><span data-astro-cid-xhit6z5e>£10.00 to £40.00<br data-astro-cid-xhit6z5e><span class=\"note\" data-astro-cid-xhit6z5e>Conditions may apply</span></span></div></div><div class=\"book-tickets-row\" data-astro-cid-xhit6z5e><a href=\"https://tickets.rafmuseum.org.uk/category/68948?branches.branchID=2042\" class=\"cta-primary\" data-astro-cid-xhit6z5e>Book tickets</a></div></div></div><div class=\"content\" data-astro-cid-63olytii><article data-astro-cid-63olytii><p data-start=\"24\" data-end=\"193\"><strong>Doors open 6.30pm.<br />\nScreenings start 7.30pm.<br />\nWeather forecast : Dry and 22 degrees each evening.</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"24\" data-end=\"193\">Join us on our Airfield for an outdoor cinema night with a supersonic twist. Watch <strong data-start=\"107\" data-end=\"118\">Top Gun</strong> and <strong data-start=\"123\" data-end=\"144\">Top Gun: Maverick</strong> under the open sky. This is cinema… with afterburners!</p>\n<p data-start=\"24\" data-end=\"193\">Arrive at from 6:30pm so you have the pick of the positions on the Airfield!</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-44578\" src=\"https://assets.rafmuseum.org.uk/app/uploads/2025/12/17093531/Top_Gun_Outdoor_Cinema_Cosford-300x200.jpg\" alt=\"Outdoor cinema\" width=\"605\" height=\"403\" srcset=\"https://assets.rafmuseum.org.uk/app/uploads/2025/12/17093531/Top_Gun_Outdoor_Cinema_Cosford-300x200.jpg 300w, https://assets.rafmuseum.org.uk/app/uploads/2025/12/17093531/Top_Gun_Outdoor_Cinema_Cosford-1024x684.jpg 1024w, https://assets.rafmuseum.org.uk/app/uploads/2025/12/17093531/Top_Gun_Outdoor_Cinema_Cosford-768x513.jpg 768w, https://assets.rafmuseum.org.uk/app/uploads/2025/12/17093531/Top_Gun_Outdoor_Cinema_Cosford-1536x1025.jpg 1536w, https://assets.rafmuseum.org.uk/app/uploads/2025/12/17093531/Top_Gun_Outdoor_Cinema_Cosford-scaled.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 605px) 100vw, 605px\" /></p>\n<p>Popcorn and a soft drink are included with all tickets, as are headphones to ensure that you enjoy superior sound quality during each screening.</p>\n<p><strong>Why not get into the spirit of the evening and come dressed as your favourite character or in an &#8217;80s style?</strong></p>\n<h5>Choose your film</h5>\n<h6>Top Gun (1986)</h6>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-44581\" src=\"https://assets.rafmuseum.org.uk/app/uploads/2025/12/17093534/top-gun-maverick-300x200.jpg\" alt=\"Tom Cruise\" width=\"595\" height=\"396\" srcset=\"https://assets.rafmuseum.org.uk/app/uploads/2025/12/17093534/top-gun-maverick-300x200.jpg 300w, https://assets.rafmuseum.org.uk/app/uploads/2025/12/17093534/top-gun-maverick-768x512.jpg 768w, https://assets.rafmuseum.org.uk/app/uploads/2025/12/17093534/top-gun-maverick.jpg 980w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 595px) 100vw, 595px\" /></p>\n<p data-start=\"946\" data-end=\"1236\">Saturday 22 August 2026 <br data-start=\"1013\" data-end=\"1016\" /><strong data-start=\"1016\" data-end=\"1038\">Film start: </strong>7.30pm <br data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1081\" /><strong data-start=\"1081\" data-end=\"1122\">Doors open (standard tickets): </strong>6.30pm <br data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1165\" /><strong data-start=\"1165\" data-end=\"1196\">Run time:</strong> 1 hour 50 minutes</p>\n<p data-start=\"1238\" data-end=\"1291\"><strong data-start=\"1238\" data-end=\"1249\">Tickets</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"1238\" data-end=\"1291\"><strong data-start=\"1294\" data-end=\"1325\">50% off Early-bird standard: </strong>£10.00 <em>(first 150 tickets)</em></li>\n<li data-start=\"1238\" data-end=\"1291\"><strong data-start=\"1390\" data-end=\"1410\">Standard: </strong>£20.00</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a class=\"cta-primary\" href=\"https://tickets.rafmuseum.org.uk/event-tickets/73531?branches.branchID=2042\">Book tickets</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"1238\" data-end=\"1291\"><strong data-start=\"1455\" data-end=\"1470\">VIP: </strong>£40.00 <em>(includes a Cold War tour, Buccaneer aircraft access and guaranteed seating)</em></li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1589\" data-end=\"1691\"><a class=\"cta-primary\" href=\"https://tickets.rafmuseum.org.uk/event-tickets/75059?branches.branchID=2042\">Book tickets</a></p>\n<p data-start=\"1693\" data-end=\"1902\">Some seating will be provided, but we recommend bringing your own to guarantee a seat. Please do not bring umbrellas or parasols, as they may block other visitors’ view.</p>\n<h6>Top Gun: Maverick (2022)</h6>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-44590\" src=\"https://assets.rafmuseum.org.uk/app/uploads/2025/12/17134538/Top-Gun-Maverick1-300x169.jpg\" alt=\"Top Gun Maverick\" width=\"594\" height=\"335\" srcset=\"https://assets.rafmuseum.org.uk/app/uploads/2025/12/17134538/Top-Gun-Maverick1-300x169.jpg 300w, https://assets.rafmuseum.org.uk/app/uploads/2025/12/17134538/Top-Gun-Maverick1-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://assets.rafmuseum.org.uk/app/uploads/2025/12/17134538/Top-Gun-Maverick1-768x432.jpg 768w, https://assets.rafmuseum.org.uk/app/uploads/2025/12/17134538/Top-Gun-Maverick1-1536x865.jpg 1536w, https://assets.rafmuseum.org.uk/app/uploads/2025/12/17134538/Top-Gun-Maverick1.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 594px) 100vw, 594px\" /></p>\n<p data-start=\"2136\" data-end=\"2425\">Sunday 23 August 2026 <br data-start=\"2201\" data-end=\"2204\" /><strong data-start=\"2204\" data-end=\"2226\">Film start: </strong>7.30pm <br data-start=\"2266\" data-end=\"2269\" /><strong data-start=\"2269\" data-end=\"2310\">Doors open (standard tickets): </strong>6.30pm <br data-start=\"2350\" data-end=\"2353\" /><strong data-start=\"2353\" data-end=\"2385\">Run time: </strong>2 hours 11 minutes</p>\n<p data-start=\"2427\" data-end=\"2480\"><strong data-start=\"2427\" data-end=\"2438\">Tickets</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"2427\" data-end=\"2480\"><strong data-start=\"2483\" data-end=\"2514\">50% off Early-bird standard: </strong>£10.00<em> (first 150 tickets)</em></li>\n<li data-start=\"2427\" data-end=\"2480\"><strong data-start=\"2579\" data-end=\"2599\">Standard: </strong>£20.00</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a class=\"cta-primary\" href=\"https://tickets.rafmuseum.org.uk/event-tickets/73534?branches.branchID=2042\">Book tickets</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"2427\" data-end=\"2480\"><strong data-start=\"2644\" data-end=\"2659\">VIP: </strong>£40.00<em> (includes a Cold War tour, Buccaneer aircraft access and guaranteed seating)</em></li>\n</ul>\n<p><a class=\"cta-primary\" href=\"https://tickets.rafmuseum.org.uk/event-tickets/75061?branches.branchID=2042\">Book tickets</a></p>\n<p data-start=\"2882\" data-end=\"3091\">Some seating will be provided, but we recommend bringing your own to guarantee a seat. Please do not bring umbrellas or parasols, as they may block other visitors’ view.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2882\" data-end=\"3091\"><strong>Feel the need&#8230; the need for snacks? Hot food including hot dogs, burgers, pancakes and waffles will be available to purchase each evening, as will alcoholic beverages, cocktails, soft drinks, tea and coffee. So fuel up before Maverick takes off.</strong></p>\n</article></div></main><footer><div class=\"footer-wrapper\"><div class=\"newsletter\"><div class=\"newsletter-copy\"><h6>Stay in the loop</h6><p>Get all the latest news and event updates straight into your inbox</p></div><div class=\"newsletter-cta\"><a class=\"cta-primary\" href=\"https://assets-gbr.mkt.dynamics.com/7af6172a-10a2-461e-8464-1f724e9d1026/digitalassets/standaloneforms/6dabe502-cd58-f011-bec2-6045bd110e5f\" target=\"_blank\">Sign&nbsp;up</a></div></div><div class=\"footer-body\"><a class=\"footer-logo\" href=\"/\"><img src=\"/assets/logos/rafm.svg\" width=\"143\" height=\"92\" alt=\"RAF Museum logo\"></a><div class=\"locations accordion\"><h6 class=\"footer-heading\">Visit us</h6><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"footer-locations\" class=\"accordion-toggle\"><label for=\"footer-locations\" class=\"accordion-button\">Visit us</label><div class=\"accordion-content\"><address><strong>RAF Museum London</strong><br>Grahame Park Way<br>London, NW9 5LL<br><div style=\"margin-top: 8px;\">SAT NAV: NW9 5QW</div></address><address><strong>RAF Museum Midlands</strong><br>Lysander Avenue,<br>Cosford, TF11 8UP<br><div style=\"margin-top: 8px;\">SAT NAV: WV7 3EU</div></address></div></div><div class=\"useful-links accordion\"><h6 class=\"footer-heading\">Useful links</h6><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"footer-links\" class=\"accordion-toggle\"><label for=\"footer-links\" class=\"accordion-button\">Useful links</label><div class=\"accordion-content\"><ul><li><a href=\"/london/venue-hire/\">London venue hire</a></li><li><a href=\"/midlands/venue-hire/\">Midlands venue hire</a></li><li><a href=\"/campaign/about-us/\">About us</a></li><li><a href=\"/contact-us/default/\">Contact us</a></li><li><a href=\"/about-us/job-vacancies/\">Jobs at the Mu